# A theme whose backdrop follows its agents: the pane of an agent waiting on the person is
# framed in warn dots along its four inside edges.
stage 1440 900
window 1440 900
replies waiting-edge-replies.json
project storefront shop
core saveTheme waiting-edge.json
prefer themeId custom-mood-rice
prefer paneBackdrop theme
chat Wren
title "Cache the product pages"
say "Cache the product pages so a page loads without asking the database each time."
settle 6
front Wren
settle 2
snap waiting
